  aciklama: "8. kat, daire 4, Y\xF6netim b\xFCrosu (asans\xF6r). Sekiz kilit: banyo
    (mente\u015Fe; kiler anahtar\u0131), kiler (kol), Oda B (evrak dolab\u0131nda
    mutfak anahtar\u0131), mutfak (salon anahtar\u0131), Oda A (\u015Fifre 1974,
    holdeki isk\xE2n ruhsat\u0131; anahtar dolab\u0131nda dosya dolab\u0131n\u0131n
    anahtar\u0131), salon (dosya dolab\u0131nda asans\xF6r\xFCn sigortas\u0131),
    asans\xF6r (sigorta panoya, \xE7a\u011F\u0131r, g\xF6sterge 9 der) -> kabinde
    \xE7at\u0131 anahtar\u0131. Oda oda d\xF6\u015Fendi (#83)."
